20260831:16:09:10:2793039 gpstop:localhost:yjf-[INFO]:-Gathering information and validating the environment...
20260831:16:09:10:2793039 gpstop:localhost:yjf-[INFO]:-Obtaining Greenplum Coordinator catalog information
20260831:16:09:10:2793039 gpstop:localhost:yjf-[INFO]:-Obtaining Segment details from coordinator...
20260831:16:09:10:2793039 gpstop:localhost:yjf-[INFO]:-Greenplum Version: 'postgres (Greenplum Database) 7.0.0-beta.0 build dev'
20260831:16:09:10:2793039 gpstop:localhost:yjf-[INFO]:-Signalling all postmaster processes to reload

-- end_ignore
(exited with code 0)
